<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container my-5" style="max-width: 800px;">
  <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h2>
  <div class="card border rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-white shadow-sm" style="line-height: 1.8;">
    <p>At <strong>Wanderlust</strong>, we prioritize the privacy and security of our guests and hosts. This Privacy Policy details how we handle and protect your personal information.</p>
    
    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">We collect information provided directly when you register, book a stay, or list a property, including your name, email, phone number, and reservation details.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. How We Use Information</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">We use your information to facilitate bookings, process secure transactions, prevent fraud and double-bookings, and provide personalized AI travel recommendations.</p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Data Protection</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">All sensitive credentials, including passwords, are hashed with industry-standard bcrypt algorithms. We never sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
  </div>
</div>
